      "revision": 1367549467,
      "text": "Thalia geniculata, the bent alligator-flag, arrowroot, or fire-flag, is a plant species widespread across tropical Africa and much of the Americas."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Thalia geniculata",
